#: ../../modules/raycast.md:1 be2dccf83a9040a1b85ea56f368e02ad
msgid "🔦 Raycast"
msgstr "🔦 射线追踪（Raycast）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:3 76efa66c9b98463ab4425a0272eb75cd
msgid "**`#bs.raycast:help`**"
msgstr "**`#bs.raycast:help`**"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:5 06bd889c7c6447fba9968e3c223c8328
msgid "Cast rays and detect collisions with blocks or entities."
msgstr "检测射线与方块或实体的碰撞。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:8 7137faf18047487c82295de77c6d02cf
msgid "\"Reality only reveals itself when it is illuminated by a ray of poetry.\""
msgstr "“现实只有在诗歌之光的照耀下才会展现自己。”"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:9 abed167d5ff94ff3b82a1d8d53d7360d
msgid "Georges Braque"
msgstr "乔治·布拉克（Georges Braque）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:13 e1424712382446dd9906bde9741029b5
msgid "Looking for simple use cases?"
msgstr "寻找简单的用例？"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:16 4004f35848a347328b5d2efa08d50067
msgid "If you just want to detect what an entity is looking at (aimed block, aimed entity, hit point), the [View module](view.md) provides simplified wrappers that handle the common cases for you."
msgstr "如果你只想检测实体正在看什么（瞄准的方块、瞄准的实体、击中点），[视图模块](view.md) 提供了简化包装器，处理常见情况。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md a3069beaa9c147c1876f0e440978c1a4
msgid "How does it work?"
msgstr "它是如何工作的？"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:23 24d6235e8bc34b39af67a6a6c68074c0
msgid "This module uses a [voxel traversal](http://www.cse.yorku.ca/~amana/research/grid.pdf) algorithm. Instead of checking points at fixed intervals, the ray steps from one block boundary to the next, ensuring every block is checked without redundant operations."
msgstr "此模块使用 [体素遍历](http://www.cse.yorku.ca/~amana/research/grid.pdf) 算法。射线从一块边界步进到下一块，而不是在固定间隔检查点，确保每个方块都被检查而无需冗余操作。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:28 d990414b62464c2d94e7466e8178122f
msgid "🔧 Functions"
msgstr "🔧 函数"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:30 d3519280bcbe486bb2b13b2ea26a5b03
msgid "You can find below all functions available in this module."
msgstr "你可以在下方找到此模块中的所有可用函数。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:34 ea1d6917d6e847fab6fe98bb14f94bef
msgid "Run"
msgstr "运行"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:38 e59a34ab6f354932ba5c2809c6974867
msgid "Cast a ray from the execution position and check if it hits something."
msgstr "在执行位置发射一条射线并检查它的碰撞情况。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:40 2cda593c3a5848378776ebe9380d2b2b
msgid "Inputs"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:41 b628d1c99a6f43429d8abbaf8a54e322
msgid "**Execution `at <entity>` or `positioned <x> <y> <z> rotated <rot>`**: origin of the ray"
msgstr "**执行 `at <实体>` 或 `positioned <x> <y> <z> rotated <rot>`**: 射线的起点和方向。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:43 df82bf3b317a46f9b60f5632522d07b1
msgid "**Function macro**:"
msgstr "**函数宏**"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:45 e7e02da59ed341e1ab22de63a6cdc142
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`compound` arguments"
msgstr "{nbt}`compound` 参数"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:46 91a28ed245ac4f578df441015076e272
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`compound` **with**: ray input data"
msgstr "{nbt}`compound` **with**: 射线输入数据。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:47 61d00e8ca4df41a1acdf61f149d5e43b
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` {nbt}`bool` **blocks**: whether the ray stops on blocks (default: true)"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` {nbt}`bool` **blocks**：射线是否在方块处停止（默认：true）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:49 84a2b2d8b47844febc55953f196ca028
msgid "*Can be a [hitbox provider](hitbox.md#available-providers) (e.g. `function #bs.hitbox:callback/get_block_collision`).*"
msgstr "*可以是 [碰撞箱提供器](hitbox.md#available-providers)（例如 `function #bs.hitbox:callback/get_block_collision`）。*"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:50 57580f7cb0d34310a065f8f63c212b5a
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` {nbt}`bool` **entities**: whether the ray stops on entities (default: false)"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` {nbt}`bool` **entities**：射线是否在实体处停止（默认：false）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:52 d4a0658bc658476391988a363bf0b9f9
msgid "*Can be a selector tag (typically assigned via `/tag`), which is preferred for performance.*"
msgstr "*可以是选择器标签（通常通过 `/tag` 分配），出于性能考虑，更推荐使用。*"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:53 ca03ebf1622c4504947ed33f33781fa3
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **ignored_blocks**: blocks to ignore (default: `#bs.hitbox:intangible`)"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **ignored_blocks**: 要忽略的方块（默认：`#bs.hitbox:intangible`）。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:54 5cf7669060814a008629e241190a520b
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **ignored_entities**: entity types to ignore (default: `#bs.hitbox:intangible`)"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **ignored_blocks**: 要忽略的方块（默认：`#bs.hitbox:intangible`）。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:56 915e3648baae4098a2b0aa0df457b50e
msgid "*Does not apply to entities with custom hitboxes.*"
msgstr "*不适用于具有自定义碰撞箱的实体。*"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:57 23437103ff4349e49639427508bf658c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`number` **max_distance**: maximum ray travel distance (default: 16.0)"
msgstr "{nbt}`number` **max_distance**: 射线最大前进距离（默认：16.0）。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:58 4f5fb2db761a48cc87f62bbb1c796d00
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **on_targeted_block**: callback to run `at` the targeted block (aligned)"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **on_targeted_block**: 在射线碰撞的方块处执行命令。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:59 96770ad0c34a401db9f97f99ecb49e24
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **on_targeted_entity**: callback to run `as` and `at` the targeted entity"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **on_targeted_entity**: 以射线碰撞的实体为执行者执行命令。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:60 a90f4ee4a08d4e12866b1c14b4152a37
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **on_entry_point**: callback to run `at` the point where the ray enters a shape"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **on_hit_point**: 在射线和其他物体的交点位置执行的命令。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:62 ../../modules/raycast.md:65
#: 70dfdbc59fcf446ba3629f6f047d25de 8b2e8f6240024d59951a888dec5319b9
msgid "*May run multiple times per block with complex shapes and piercing.*"
msgstr "*对于复杂形状和穿透，可能每个方块运行多次。*"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:63 0259a96edf6b4ebbaafe1f75005b8db4
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **on_exit_point**: callback to run `at` the point where the ray exits a shape"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **on_hit_point**: 在射线和其他物体的交点位置执行的命令。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:66 f303abdcaa5e491293b566581c7af7e6
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`int` {nbt}`compound` **piercing**: blocks or entities the ray can pass through (default: `0`)"
msgstr "{nbt}`int` **piercing**: 射线可以穿过实体或方块的最大次数（默认：0）。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:67 7befe18e69094ed0a4166e5731e81c97
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`int` **blocks**: blocks to track independently from entities (default: `0`)"
msgstr "{nbt}`int` **blocks**: blocks to track independently from entities (default: `0`)"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:68 5aea0658b56c43ff8f329cacd96df403
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`int` **entities**: entities to track independently from blocks (default: `0`)"
msgstr "{nbt}`int` **entities**: entities to track independently from blocks (default: `0`)"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:71 f03ee3c9fa3e45bca4e1e263906620de
msgid "Lambdas"
msgstr "Lambda 函数"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:72 8b87345b7c2c42069ad89ed8c23a7b25
msgid "**Score `$raycast.entry_distance bs.lambda`**: distance from origin to the entry point (×1000)"
msgstr "**记分板 `$raycast.entry_distance bs.lambda`**：从原点到进入点的距离（×1000）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:74 5ec11e8fc92546ebbc0bdae898c659b1
msgid "**Score `$raycast.exit_distance bs.lambda`**: distance from origin to the exit point (×1000)"
msgstr "**记分板 `$raycast.exit_distance bs.lambda`**：从原点到退出点的距离（×1000）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:76 764040180189448d88db3882809297a6
msgid "**Score `$raycast.prev_entry_distance bs.lambda`**: entry distance from the previous hit (×1000)"
msgstr "**记分板 `$raycast.prev_entry_distance bs.lambda`**：上一次击中的进入距离（×1000）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:78 6ced1ba4ab88442dbf99fbe2cca984d5
msgid "**Score `$raycast.prev_exit_distance bs.lambda`**: exit distance from the previous hit (×1000)"
msgstr "**记分板 `$raycast.prev_exit_distance bs.lambda`**：上一次击中的退出距离（×1000）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:80 9020e297d9344511b7975dd413ed82e4
msgid "**Score `$raycast.hit_face bs.lambda`**: entry face of the bounding box, `5` is east, `4` is west, `3` is south, `2` is north, `1` is top, and `0` is bottom"
msgstr "**记分板 `$raycast.hit_face bs.lambda`**：边界框的进入面，`5` 为东，`4` 为西，`3` 为南，`2` 为北，`1` 为顶部，`0` 为底部"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:82 dd704eb76e2a4bed9eb5673e35661891
msgid "**Score `$raycast.hit_flag bs.lambda`**: flag of the intersected bounding box, `-1` for entities"
msgstr "**记分板 `$raycast.hit_flag bs.lambda`**：相交边界框的标志，`-1` 表示实体"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:84 24479a5c861648d786f1007e8a11a7e3
msgid "**Score `$raycast.piercing bs.lambda`**: remaining number of blocks or entities the ray can pass through"
msgstr "{nbt}`int` **piercing**: 射线可以穿过实体或方块的最大次数（默认：0）。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:86 6eae8ee394774a2bb9f637229427b65d
msgid "**Scores `$raycast.entry_point.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`**: entry point relative to the block or entity (×1000)"
msgstr "**记分板 `$raycast.entry_point.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`**：相对于方块或实体的进入点（×1000）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:88 7757aa722ff3417684297704e026aad4
msgid "**Scores `$raycast.exit_point.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`**: exit point relative to the block or entity (×1000)"
msgstr "**记分板 `$raycast.exit_point.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`**：相对于方块或实体的退出点（×1000）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:90 cf2e8b2bb5d5493593d61cb69f8040e2
msgid "**Scores `$raycast.targeted_block.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`**: coordinates of the targeted block"
msgstr "**记分板 `$raycast.targeted_block.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`**：目标方块的坐标"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:92 cbf4b5bdeba94edf807eb5397160f815
msgid "Outputs"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:93 915d10908f164822baa797a20ce4d898
msgid "**Return**: whether the ray collides with a hitbox or not (1 or 0)"
msgstr "**返回值**：射线是否与碰撞箱相撞（1或0）。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md 59eba54f6650493a9a1fb8b26167560f
msgid "What is a bounding box?"
msgstr "什么是边界框？"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:100 c64954053a6b44049e468cf3bc558f77
msgid "A bounding box is a rectangular box that surrounds an object—or part of it—to detect where it is and what it touches. For example, stairs use two bounding boxes: one for the lower step and one for the upper step."
msgstr "边界框是一个矩形框，环绕物体（或物体的一部分），用于检测其位置和接触对象。例如，楼梯使用两个边界框：一个用于下台阶，一个用于上台阶。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 264958a963e54886ae7c9c2401ba485c
msgid "Custom hitboxes"
msgstr "自定义碰撞箱"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:106 1eb67fa72bc943bb84bead845d7d2275
msgid "Bookshelf supports multiple [hitbox types](hitbox.md#hitbox-types) for precise control. Blocks can use custom [hitbox providers](hitbox.md#available-providers). Entities support `dynamic`, `baked`, and `custom` types."
msgstr "Bookshelf 支持多种碰撞箱类型以实现精确控制。方块可使用 `interaction` 或 `collision` 碰撞箱，实体支持三种类型：`dynamic`、`baked` 和 `custom`。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:109 87eb7bc84ee5488295d852a2dbf31d52
msgid "**Credits**: Aksiome"
msgstr "**贡献者**：Aksiome"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:113 f4b7a6bcd91e49478037562e9c6b9124
msgid "🎓 How to use"
msgstr "🎓 使用方法"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:115 cc39a5134ba647809369f17c740a36f0
msgid "Basic raycast"
msgstr "🔦 射线追踪（Raycast）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:117 5944a09fca8a403d87af04cf22d00aa9
msgid "At its simplest, a raycast checks if something is in front of you and returns `1` (hit) or `0` (miss):"
msgstr "最简单的情况下，射线检测检查你前方是否有物体，并返回 `1`（击中）或 `0`（未击中）："

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:124 20d73f2ed8cf418a804ffb0f17c538e9
msgid "By default, rays detect blocks but not entities. The return value tells you if a collision occurred."
msgstr "默认情况下，射线检测方块但不检测实体。返回值告诉你是否发生了碰撞。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:128 8e168dc866774fc28e89b0a5f88e7eb0
msgid "Using callbacks"
msgstr "使用回调"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:130 8b3111982e2341adadb490fcec99b299
msgid "Callbacks let you run commands when the ray hits something. There are four callback types:"
msgstr "回调允许你在射线击中物体时运行命令。有四种回调类型："

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 42c583b92aa247e589296db6f6ffbbba
msgid "Callback"
msgstr "回调"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 ebe2415c2a3547cd97f3c8dc191b97bf
msgid "Runs at"
msgstr "运行位置"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 16e48e426e964dfdbde8b82b25ab58d3
msgid "Use case"
msgstr "用例"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 41462ca66cdf45a69f686853ba91463c
msgid "`on_targeted_block`"
msgstr "`on_targeted_block`"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 7f71057134a6409da62b3e395dc37832
msgid "Aligned block position"
msgstr "对齐的方块位置"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 26b97dad42de4101a1e971ff31332c53
msgid "Place/break blocks, check block type"
msgstr "放置/破坏方块，检查方块类型"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 544b69cfadac4fa1b7450b15f2c52b8e
msgid "`on_targeted_entity`"
msgstr "`on_targeted_entity`"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 dc597599c78f4b5b8a344de6bd66f732
msgid "Entity position (as & at)"
msgstr "实体位置（as & at）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 21234c0f9708436fb2ebc7c378e3159e
msgid "Damage, tag, or interact with entity"
msgstr "伤害、标记或与实体交互"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 5c8ed9764be7499e9d3cd572740fa24b
msgid "`on_entry_point`"
msgstr "`on_entry_point`"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 71164240bae84a588b858d5704b9b368
msgid "Exact point where ray enters"
msgstr "射线进入的精确点"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 ec647e1689a14bf998ea4261d580c462
msgid "Spawn particles, precise hit effects"
msgstr "生成粒子，精确击中效果"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 3dfa1823a648481a96184456bb4f4848
msgid "`on_exit_point`"
msgstr "`on_exit_point`"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 d222deae9f0e43e49978b2827a220078
msgid "Exact point where ray exits"
msgstr "射线退出的精确点"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:103 d021e986a55f46b1920941088a2404f1
msgid "Through-hit effects, exit wounds"
msgstr "穿透效果，出口伤"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:139 3f4a68c607f94a08b3aaae5768b695b5
msgid "*Example: spawn a particle exactly where your ray hits a block*"
msgstr "*示例：在射线击中方块的确切位置生成粒子*"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:147 261c0cbf7358447cab8b40ecc7a23425
msgid "Configuring detection"
msgstr "配置检测"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:149 a87434c258b14932b53f9826e94bbdfe
msgid "By default, rays detect blocks but not entities. You can change this with the `blocks` and `entities` parameters."
msgstr "默认情况下，射线检测方块但不检测实体。您可以使用 `blocks` 和 `entities` 参数更改此设置。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:151 30ba76702cc644a9ac471bc2b892e1dd
msgid "**Blocks** accepts `true` (default), `false`, or a [hitbox provider](hitbox.md#available-providers)."
msgstr "**Blocks** 接受 `true`（默认）、`false` 或 [hitbox provider](hitbox.md#available-providers)。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:158 54327d8461b14cbb90a6570bb144cf75
msgid "**Entities** accepts `true`, `false` (default), or an entity tag to filter which entities can be hit."
msgstr "**Entities** 接受 `true`、`false`（默认）或一个实体标签来筛选可被击中的实体。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:169 7924f50e52084f1facaba814b80acda3
msgid "Using a tag selector (`entities:\"my_tag\"`) is more performant than `entities:true` because it narrows down which entities to check."
msgstr "使用标签选择器（`entities:\"my_tag\"`）比 `entities:true` 性能更好，因为它缩小了要检查的实体范围。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:174 f82e9046a6094115805188d0b30b111b
msgid "Filtering targets"
msgstr "筛选目标"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:176 1796c9c02a7543bb803b4ec1faccd09b
msgid "Use `ignored_blocks` and `ignored_entities` to specify which targets the ray should skip:"
msgstr "使用 `ignored_blocks` 和 `ignored_entities` 指定射线应跳过的目标："

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:186 0189811dcf194d05b382457388a11e9b
msgid "Defaults:"
msgstr "默认值："

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:187 ac8b1cd35e514668b4ff50836b9e8b14
msgid "`ignored_blocks`: `#bs.hitbox:intangible` (blocks that cannot be physically interacted with)"
msgstr "`ignored_blocks`：`#bs.hitbox:intangible`（无法物理交互的方块）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:188 94a8ed04f8ab4b77b28d540b39912e02
msgid "`ignored_entities`: `#bs.hitbox:intangible` (entities that don't act as physical obstacles)"
msgstr "`ignored_entities`：`#bs.hitbox:intangible`（不充当物理障碍的实体）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:192 e2cdd6bab6f64bcd87926afabf8a3cb3
msgid "Piercing"
msgstr "穿透"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:194 23be51d2e728423fbe3962af6da52c1f
msgid "By default, rays stop at the first collision. Use `piercing` to let rays pass through multiple targets:"
msgstr "默认情况下，射线在第一次碰撞时停止。使用 `piercing` 让射线穿过多个目标："

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:201 1c3ecfdd286e43f08893136f34c53e90
msgid "You can also track blocks and entities separately:"
msgstr "您还可以分别跟踪方块和实体："

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:210 c458e1c7282b444388887323320aeccd
msgid "Lambda scores"
msgstr "Lambda 函数"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:212 e57f3647c8244ec8b11050d3effb956b
msgid "Lambda scores provide detailed information about the collision, available only inside callbacks. See the function reference above for the full list."
msgstr "Lambda 分数提供关于碰撞的详细信息，仅在回调内部可用。请参阅上面的函数参考以获取完整列表。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:214 727802690f0c4cfd831c059015c41d56
msgid "Common use cases:"
msgstr "常见用例："

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:215 d7b8651176f84b6997ecd258a91230bd
msgid "`$raycast.entry_distance` - how far the hit is from the ray origin"
msgstr "`$raycast.entry_distance` - 击中点距离射线原点的距离"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:216 53de46f029d04889af38c50edba9ba76
msgid "`$raycast.entry_point.[x,y,z]` - exact hit position relative to the target"
msgstr "`$raycast.entry_point.[x,y,z]` - 相对于目标的精确击中位置"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:217 425ce672ae6341e891f424c54651e0f7
msgid "`$raycast.hit_face` - which face was hit (`0`=bottom, `1`=top, `2`=north, `3`=south, `4`=west, `5`=east)"
msgstr "`$raycast.hit_face` - 击中的面（`0`=底部，`1`=顶部，`2`=北，`3`=南，`4`=西，`5`=东）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:218 22ea711887484d87a85cc51b13136c02
msgid "`$raycast.hit_flag` - which hitbox shape was hit (provider-dependent, `-1` for entities)"
msgstr "`$raycast.hit_flag` - 击中的碰撞箱形状（取决于提供者，实体为 `-1`）"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:221 f27818895d4c42e1a63f0ce5cf691050
msgid "Position scores (`entry_point`, `exit_point`) have different reference points:"
msgstr "位置分数（`entry_point`、`exit_point`）有不同的参考点："

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:222 9d2586f8473249d2a33231b2cad8254b
msgid "**Blocks**: relative to the aligned block position"
msgstr "**方块**：相对于对齐的方块位置"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:223 57246e8be7bd427aba7b9417026f887a
msgid "**Entities**: relative to the entity's position"
msgstr "**实体**：相对于实体的位置"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:228 93f95239a26e4e938a2c6065a9976c1c
msgid "Hitbox providers"
msgstr "碰撞箱类型"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:230 315199f10092462dbebecaea1f9e588b
msgid "Hitbox providers control which block shapes the ray detects. The default only detects solid collision shapes, but you can use other providers to detect additional shapes like fluids."
msgstr "碰撞箱提供者控制射线检测的方块形状。默认只检测实心碰撞形状，但您可以使用其他提供者来检测其他形状，如流体。"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:237 1fc4a02ab62049359acd663a5024400c
msgid "Providers can define multiple shapes with different flags. When this happens:"
msgstr "提供者可以定义具有不同标志的多个形状。当发生这种情况时："

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:238 33a6f604371e47e4baf19cbe002193eb
msgid "`on_targeted_block` runs once per block, with `$raycast.hit_flag` combining all intersected shapes"
msgstr "`on_targeted_block` 每个方块运行一次，`$raycast.hit_flag` 组合所有相交的形状"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:239 f17f2a9c2b31468a84f50ddfed47ed14
msgid "`on_entry_point` and `on_exit_point` run once per shape, with `$raycast.hit_flag` set to that shape's flag"
msgstr "`on_entry_point` 和 `on_exit_point` 每个形状运行一次，`$raycast.hit_flag` 设置为该形状的标志"

#: ../../modules/raycast.md:241 048fb61f57a548c891b7b5f7af21e890
msgid "For example, the fluid provider uses `1` for solid and `2` for fluid. A waterlogged block could trigger entry/exit callbacks twice (with flag `1` and `2`), and `on_targeted_block` once with flag `3`."
msgstr "例如，流体提供者对固体使用 `1`，对流体使用 `2`。含水的方块可能触发入口/出口回调两次（带有标志 `1` 和 `2`），而 `on_targeted_block` 一次带有标志 `3`。"

#: ../../_templates/comments.md:4 a38f05b356d14e328a9c31bbf0f32a60
msgid "**💬 Did it help you?**"
msgstr "**💬 这对你有帮助吗？**"

#: ../../_templates/comments.md:6 effb3d8e9beb441db632109075391944
msgid "Feel free to leave your questions and feedback below!"
msgstr "欢迎在下方留下你的问题和反馈！"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`bool` **blocks**: Whether the ray should stop on blocks (default: true)."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`bool` **blocks**: 射线能否被方块阻挡（默认: true）。"

#~ msgid "Collision / Interaction Shape"
#~ msgstr "碰撞/交互形状"

#~ msgid "**Collision Shape**: Defines the physical boundaries of a block that entities cannot pass through. It determines where an entity will stop when moving towards the block."
#~ msgstr "**碰撞形状（collision_shape）**：实体无法穿过的方块的物理边界，决定实体在靠近方块时会被阻挡在什么位置。"

#~ msgid "**Interaction Shape**: Defines the area where the player can interact with or break the block. This includes actions such as right-clicking to open a GUI (e.g., chests, furnaces) or mining the block. Some blocks have an interaction shape but no collision, such as crops or scaffolding."
#~ msgstr "**交互形状（interaction_shape）**：玩家可以与方块交互或破坏的区域。这包括右键打开 GUI（如箱子、熔炉）或采掘方块等操作。有些方块有交互形状但没有碰撞，比如农作物或脚手架。"

#~ msgid "Unlike traditional raycasts, this module uses a [voxel traversal algorithm](http://www.cse.yorku.ca/~amana/research/grid.pdf) which provides much greater precision. Additionally, thanks to the `bs.hitbox` module, it supports all different hitbox types, including both blocks and entities."
#~ msgstr "与传统的射线检测不同，此模块使用[体素遍历算法](http://www.cse.yorku.ca/~amana/research/grid.pdf)提供更高的精度。此外，得益于 `bs.hitbox` 模块，它支持所有不同的碰撞箱类型，包括方块和实体。"

#~ msgid "Run the Raycast"
#~ msgstr "运行射线检测"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`bool` {nbt}`string` **blocks**: Whether the ray stops on blocks (default: true). Can be a block hitbox type (`interaction` or `collision`). `true` defaults to `interaction`."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`bool` {nbt}`string` **blocks**: 控制射线是否被方块阻挡（默认：true），可指定阻挡类型为方块碰撞箱（`interaction`或`collision`），`true` 默认等价于 `interaction`。"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`bool` {nbt}`string` **entities**: Whether the ray stops on entities (default: false). Can be an entity tag. For performance, tagging entities to detect is recommended."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`bool` {nbt}`string` **entities**: 控制射线是否被实体阻挡（默认：false），可指定实体标签（使用/tag添加的标签）作为筛选条件。为优化性能，建议通过标签标记需检测的实体。"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`string` **ignored_entities**: Entities to ignore (default: `#bs.hitbox:intangible`). Does not apply to entities with custom hitboxes."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`string` **ignored_entities**: 要忽略的实体（默认：`#bs.hitbox:intangible`）。这不会忽略那些有自定义（custom）碰撞箱的实体。"

#~ msgid "**Score `$raycast.piercing bs.lambda`**: The remaining number of blocks or entities the ray can pass through before stopping. This score can be dynamically updated inside callbacks (`on_*`) to modify ray behavior."
#~ msgstr "**分数 `$raycast.piercing bs.lambda`**：射线在停止之前可以穿过的剩余方块或实体数量。此分数可以在回调（`on_*`）内动态更新以修改射线行为。"

#~ msgid "**Storage `bs:lambda raycast`**:"
#~ msgstr "**命令存储 `bs:lambda raycast`**："

#~ msgid "{nbt}`compound` Ray lambda data, accessible only in callbacks (`on_*`)"
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`compound` 射线过程量数据，只在回调中使用（`on_*`）。"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`double` **distance**: The distance from the ray's origin to the impact point."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`double` **distance**: 射线的起点到碰撞点的距离。"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`list` **hit_point**: The coordinates of the impact point."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`list` **hit_point**: 射线碰撞点的坐标。"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`list` **hit_normal**: The normal of the surface the ray hits."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`list` **hit_normal**: 射线碰撞面的法线坐标。"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`list` **targeted_block**: The coordinates of the block that was hit."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`list` **targeted_block**: 射线碰撞到的方块坐标。"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`list` **targeted_entity**: The UUID array of the entity that was hit."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`list` **targeted_entity**: 射线碰撞到的实体的UUID数组。"

#~ msgid "**Storage `bs:out raycast`**:"
#~ msgstr "**命令存储 `bs:out raycast`**："

#~ msgid "{nbt}`compound` Ray output data"
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`compound` 射线输出数据"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`list` **hit_normal**: The normal of the surface the ray hit."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`list` **hit_normal**: 射线碰撞面的法线。"

#~ msgid "See [Hitbox Types](hitbox.md#types) for full details."
#~ msgstr "完整说明请参见[碰撞箱类型](hitbox.md#types)。"

#~ msgid "*Example: Cast a ray from your eyes and detect any collisions:*"
#~ msgstr "*示例：从你的视线发射射线并检测是否有碰撞：*"
